# sync-delete.list — opt-in deletion manifest for the my-posts example.
# One path per line, relative to the repo root. Blank lines and '#' comments
# are ignored. A trailing slash deletes a whole directory.
#
# List a path here AND remove the file from posts/ to retire a page. The sync
# workflow applies these deletions after copying, so they win over the copy.
# This example file intentionally lists nothing — it documents the format.

# posts/en/old-draft.md
# posts/zh/old-draft.md
